{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../GeneralForumTopicUnhidden/", "title": "GeneralForumTopicUnhidden"}, "next": {"link": "../InputMediaPhoto/", "title": "InputMediaPhoto"}, "title": "InputMedia", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"inputmedia\">\n<h1>InputMedia<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#inputmedia\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.InputMedia\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMedia</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.InputMedia\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Content of a media message to be sent.</p>\n<p>It should be one of:</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InputMediaAnimation/#pyrogram.types.InputMediaAnimation\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InputMediaAnimation\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMediaAnimation</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InputMediaDocument/#pyrogram.types.InputMediaDocument\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InputMediaDocument\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMediaDocument</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InputMediaAudio/#pyrogram.types.InputMediaAudio\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InputMediaAudio\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMediaAudio</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InputMediaPhoto/#pyrogram.types.InputMediaPhoto\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InputMediaPhoto\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMediaPhoto</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../InputMediaVideo/#pyrogram.types.InputMediaVideo\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InputMediaVideo\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMediaVideo</span></code></a></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/InputMediaPhoto", "InputMediaPhoto", "N", "next"], ["api/types/GeneralForumTopicUnhidden", "GeneralForumTopicUnhidden", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">InputMedia</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.InputMedia\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMedia</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/InputMedia", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}